/*
 * Implements semantic validation for field access on class instances in Ymir.
 *
 * Supported contexts:
 *   - normal class field access
 *   - class-field-access type(ClassFieldAccType) during constructor pre-body
 *   - special meta-fields: typeinfo, typeid, super
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::validator::value::operator::fields::class_::field
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/validator/value/operator/fields/class_/field.yr
 * @Author(s):
 *   - Emile Cadorel <ecadorel@gmail.com>
 *
 * @Created(YYYY-MM-DD): 2026-04-21
 * @Copyright(C) 2021–2026 GNU-Ymir
 * @License
 *   ```text
